.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.PATHS 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.paths ,
.Nm mk.paths.darwin.mk ,
.Nm mk.paths.linux.mk ,
.Nm mk.paths.freebsd.mk ,
.Nm mk.paths.netbsd.mk ,
.Nm mk.paths.default.mk
.Nd where tools are looked for, per host
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Each file sets the prefixes searched for a compiler, for libraries a
.Xr mk.lib.mk 5
import has not otherwise resolved, and for
.Cm header:
entries of
.Xr mk.requires.mk 5 .
.Xr mk.common.mk 5
reads the one for the host, or
.Pa mk.paths.default.mk .
.Pp
Not included directly by a makefile.
.Bl -column "mk.paths.freebsd.mk" "prefixes" -offset indent
.It Pa mk.paths.linux.mk Ta Pa /usr/bin /usr/local/bin
.It Pa mk.paths.freebsd.mk Ta Pa /usr/bin /usr/local/bin
.It Pa mk.paths.netbsd.mk Ta Pa /usr/bin /usr/pkg/bin /usr/local/bin
.It Pa mk.paths.darwin.mk Ta Pa /opt/local/bin /opt/homebrew/bin /usr/local/bin /opt/pkg/bin ...
.It Pa mk.paths.default.mk Ta Pa /usr/bin /usr/local/bin
.El
.Pp
On macOS the base system is not the intended default: a package manager's tools
come first.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mk.common.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.lib.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.requires.mk 5 ,
.Xr bmake-it 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
